  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_exposure_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>增加 1 EV 使线性光强翻倍，降低 1 EV 则减半。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_lightness_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>独立调整感知明度，与曝光分别控制。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_gamma_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>增大时提亮中间调，并保留黑白端点。</value></data>
