  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_vibrance_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>更多增强中低色度颜色，减少对已有鲜艳颜色的提升。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_neutralProtect_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>减弱白平衡、颜色偏移和三向调色对原始灰色区域的染色。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_skinProtect_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>保护指定肤色色域，减弱自然饱和度和八色混合器对其影响。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_clarity_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>增强较大范围的明暗结构，过高可能产生光晕。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_textureStrength_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>增强高于噪声阈值的细小明暗纹理。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_chromaSmooth_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>平滑彩色噪点，并保护明暗边缘。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_deband_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>平滑渐变中的细小色阶差异，阈值过高可能减弱细节。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_bloom_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>将高亮颜色扩散到周围，半径与强度控制扩散范围。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_dehaze_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>从邻近像素估计局部空气光与透射率，用于降低雾感。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_autoExposure_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>根据捕获帧的平均对数亮度自动调整曝光。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_autoWhite_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>根据平均颜色修正偏色，需要保留场景主色调时可锁定。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_autoLock_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>保持当前自动调整估计，直到解除锁定。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_autoSpeed_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>适应时间，单位为秒；值越大变化越慢。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_whiteTint_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>以 CIE xy 的 Δy 调整目标白点，0 使用黑体轨迹近似。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_outputGamut_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>约束调整后的 HDR 颜色；SDR 始终映射到 sRGB。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_referenceWhite_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>HDR 工作参考白的尼特值，不改变普通 SDR 的颜色合同。</value></data>
  <data name="EffectParam_OKLabImageAdjustment_dither_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>在输出存储前加入固定像素噪声；HDR 强度按参考白定义。</value></data>
